---
/** Hero decoration: fading tech grid + a light beam from the top. Parent needs `relative isolate`. */
---

<div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 -z-10 overflow-hidden">
  <div class="hero-grid absolute inset-0"></div>
  <div class="hero-beam absolute left-1/2 top-0 h-[36rem] w-[64rem] max-w-none -translate-x-1/2"></div>
</div>
